# Shell scripts must keep LF line endings.
#
# This machine has core.autocrlf=true, which would otherwise check these out
# with CRLF. A shell script with CRLF fails on Linux and macOS with a
# "bad interpreter" error, so the hook would silently stop working for anyone
# who is not on Windows.
*.sh text eol=lf
.githooks/* text eol=lf
